<title>HONG KONG: Trade in CCT Telecom shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trade in CCT Telecom shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of CCT Telecom Holdings Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Stock Exchange of Hong Kong said on Thursday.  </p>
<p>Shares of the telecommunications equipment maker closed Wednesday unchanged at HK$0.385.</p>
<p>It said in March that independent third party Laserlight Ltd would hold 11.1 percent of CCT's enlarged share capital after Laserlight exercised HK$40 million in convertible bonds issued by the company.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6369</p>
